  data: {
    LLM: "With multiple sets, it is much easier to find an identical 'Eye'. Focus on the 'Sum-Pairs' first, as they determine the flow of your hand.\n\nHoarding: If you see that 6-6 tiles are appearing frequently in discards, start hoarding 4-4 or 3-1 to complete 10/20 sums. The Big game is about recognizing high-volume numbers.\n\nDefensive Discarding: Observe the 'Sum' your neighbors are building. If your neighbor is picking up low-value tiles (1s and 2s), don't discard any 8s or 9s—you are likely giving them their 10-sum.",
    Player: "With multiple sets, it is much easier to find an identical 'Eye'. Focus on the 'Sum-Pairs' first, as they determine the flow of your hand.\n\nHoarding: If you see that 6-6 tiles are appearing frequently in discards, start hoarding 4-4 or 3-1 to complete 10/20 sums. The Big game is about recognizing high-volume numbers.\n\nDefensive Discarding: Observe the 'Sum' your neighbors are building. If your neighbor is picking up low-value tiles (1s and 2s), don't discard any 8s or 9s—you are likely giving them their 10-sum.",
